t face=3D"微软雅黑" >星型模型，雪花模型进行数据模型设计</font></span><span style=3D"mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:微软雅黑;font-size:12.0000pt;=20mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" ><font face=3D"微软雅黑" >，主要包括维度表和事实表的设计</font><font face=3D"微软雅黑" >(不展开)， 其中实体通常以</font></span><span style=3D"mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:微软雅黑;color:rgb(255,0,0);=20font-size:12.0000pt;mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" ><font face=3D"微软雅黑" >DIM（DIM =3D Dimension =3D 维度）维度表形式</font></span><span style=3D"mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:微软雅黑;font-size:12.0000pt;=20mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" ><font face=3D"微软雅黑" >构建。比如：供应商维表、商品维表等。业务过程以</font><font face=3D"微软雅黑" >DWD事实表形式构建。比如：采购单流水表、入库流水表、出库流水表等;</font></span><span style=3D"mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:微软雅黑;font-size:12.0000pt;=20mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" ><o:p></o:p></span></p><p class=3D19  style=3D"mso-pagination:widow-orphan;" ><span style=3D"mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:微软雅黑;font-size:12.0000pt;=20mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" >&nbsp;</span><span style=3D"mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:微软雅黑;font-size:12.0000pt;=20mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" ><o:p></o:p></span></p></div><!--EndFragment--></body></html>

